  "text_content": "Menu Student Files Classes Instructor Open submenu Reports Open submenu Set Class Schedule School Permits Close submenu Instructor Instructor Schedule Open submenu Instructor Reports Open submenu My Signatures Close submenu Instructor Schedule Booked Appointments Specify Hours Close submenu Instructor Reports Work Summary To Do Lists Close submenu Reports AQTR Registrations Ilan Preisler logout Actions print contract print attestation phase 1 print attestation phase 1 (empty) print attestation phase 4 print attestation phase 4 (empty) course transfer delete course Summer Campbell Course Info Course Automobile Location Dollard-des-Ormeaux Start Date Aug 21, 2025 Contract No 1235676 edit Attestation No 03277144 Attestation Date Oct 31, 2025 Class 5 Learner's License C5148-170609-08 Issue Date of Class 5 Nov 20, 2025 On-road Instructor Gary Trace Passed SAAQ Knowledge Test? no edit Personal Info Campbell, Summer 278 Place des Cèdres, Dollard-Des Ormeaux, QC H9G 1W1 Jun 17, 2009 English scampbellxoxo@icloud.com 438-820-6564 (cell) edit Office Use Only - Notes STUDENT NEEDS TO WEAR HER GLASSES AT ALL TIMES FOR DRIVING!! Will make payment on October 1st, 2025. Do not give attestation papers until first payment has been received. -Galit Student called to book in-car 1 on Nov 21st; In-car 2 on Nov 25th; in-car 3 on Dec 2nd and in-car 4 Dec 11th with Guy. Dina Nov 21st Guy cancelled app of Dec 11 and student rebooked for today Dec 15th. Dina - Dec 15th Student came with no glasses (forgot) she cannot see well. Guy cancelled her app. NS fees were added to account. I rebooked student with Phil on Dec 17th. Dina - Dec 15th Student called at 2:29pm to say she missed her app with Phil for today Dec 17th cuz she had to pick up child at daycare. She rescheduled her in-car 4 for tomorrow Dec 18th. She was advised NS fees will be applied to her account. Dina - Dec 17th NS with Phil on Dec. 18th, 2025 - 1 hour. Student called at 3:30pm to ask when her appointment was scheduled. Student was advised that she was 30 minutes late and could no longer complete her in-car session. Additional Fee of $50 +tax was added to balance. -Anika- Dec. 18th, 2025 In-car 4 booked with Phil on Dec. 20th, 2025 | 5:30pm-6:30pm -Anika DO NOT REFUND ANY IN-CAR NO SHOW FEES. ilan 18/dec/25 Sent an email to student explain the office error. Student was refunded. -Anika- Dec. 18th, 2025 Instructor signed student in by mistake. Student showed up to do her in-car 4 but forgot her glasses - was suppose to be a NO SHOW, but was signed in instead. There was no an in office error. Student was scheduled to complete her in-car 4 and never showed up twice. *Fees to be added to balance is depending*. I called the student but could only leave an voice message. An email will be sent to her shortly explain exactly this. -Anika- Dec. 19th, 2025 Spoke to student - Because of the confusion, student was advised (and agreed) that only $50 +tax would be add to her balance, instead on $100 +tax. -Anika- Dec. 19th, 2025 In-car 4 booked with Phil on Dec. 20th, 2025 | 5:30pm-6:30pm -Anika NS with Guy On Dec 11th came with no glasses'; fees had not been added on her account. I charged her today. Dina - Dec 21st. February 20th, 2026, student will come to office to pay $500; having financial issues. I agreed to book more in-cars before her payment on the 20th. -Natalie, Feb. 5, 2026- Save Cancel edit To Do (Instructor) sign in for practical lesson #6 Up Next Theory 10 Feb 15, 2026 5:00pm-7:00pm via Zoom Zoom Cancel Theory 9 Feb 23, 2026 7:00pm-9:00pm via Zoom Zoom Cancel attendPractical_6 0 Module History Theory 1 Aug 21, 2025 5:00pm-7:00pm delete time student instructor 5:00pm-6:00pm Zoom screenshot reveal signature L12618 6:00pm-7:00pm Zoom screenshot reveal signature L12618 Theory 2 Aug 28, 2025 5:00pm-7:00pm delete time student instructor 5:00pm-6:00pm Zoom screenshot reveal signature L12618 6:00pm-7:00pm Zoom screenshot reveal signature L12618 Theory 3 Aug 27, 2025 5:00pm-7